432,4433,4434,4435,4436,4437,4438,4439,4440,4441,4442,4443,4444,4445,4446,4447,4448,4449,4450,4451,4452,4453,4454,4455,4456,4457,4458,4459,4460,4461,4462,4463,4464,4465,4466],"projection_sha256":"decdcb9a454efec1003e02d8ec5cfa2f82a1c1c505ff426f5bc3a513db2d6a6c","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-014-wangyong","book_id":"b-chenshu-014","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-014-wangyong-ws2262003"},{"id":"c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p002","text":"衡陽王伯信字孚之，世祖第七子也。","mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p002:m0003","surface":"伯信","start":3,"end":5,"person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context:p002:m0006","surface":"孚之","start":6,"end":8,"person_id":"5ye_fwj_neh_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2581394,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":35,"last_line":35,"line_start":2,"line_end":18,"raw_start":2894,"raw_end":2910,"raw_character_offsets":[2894,2895,2896,2897,2898,2899,2900,2901,2902,2903,2904,2905,2906,2907,2908,2909],"projection_sha256":"afe6a6f61031805acb6232e5f967d64373eadab68645c2cce0bd0beb4717eb0b","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context","book_id":"b-chenshu-028","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-028-wangmeng-commanders-context-ws2581394"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004","text":"禎明二年，詔授鎭南大將軍、都督二十四州諸軍事，尋命徙鎭廣州。未之鎭，而隋師濟江，猛總督所部赴援。時廣州刺史臨汝侯方慶、西衡州刺史衡陽王伯信並隸猛督府，各觀望不至。猛使高州刺史戴智烈、清遠太守曾孝遠各以輕兵就斬之而發其兵。及聞台城不守，乃舉哀素服，藉稿不食，歎曰：「申包胥獨何人哉。」因勒兵緣江拒守，以固誠節。及審後主不死，乃遣其部將辛昉馳驛赴京師歸款。隋文帝大悅，謂昉曰：「猛懷其舊主，送故情深，即是我之誠臣。保守一方，不勞兵甲，又是我之功臣。」即日拜昉開府儀同三司，仍詔猛與行軍總管韋洸便留嶺表經略。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangmeng:p004:m0040","surface":"猛","start":40,"end":41,"person_id":"72e_1a7_3ac_AAAA","kind":"person"